# Scientific framing

This is a synthetic benchmark for latent-state recovery, attractor
fingerprinting, and ontology mismatch detection on a controlled
generator. It is NOT a biological simulator and does NOT constitute
evidence for Traditional Chinese Medicine, Qi, or any clinical claim.
Any reuse — code, data, or both — should preserve that framing.
